<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Genders</h1>
<p>When you create a character, you choose to play a male or a female. Your 
choice doesn't have to match who you are in real life.
</p><p>The difference in the game is small, and lies in the body: in most races 
the males are somewhat heavier, and often a little taller, than the 
females, while among humans, half-ogres and a few others the females tend 
to live a little longer (see <a cmd='#'>Help Age</a>). Gnome women are the exception: 
they stand a little taller than the men. Abilities, guilds and skills are 
the same for both; only the titles a guild gives you as you rise are 
masculine or feminine.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Races</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Age</a>
